WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.999 line:0
Spades: North–South vs East–West; spades are trump.
Partners’ bids add up to the team contract.

00:00:06.999 --> 00:00:13.099 line:0
North bids 3 and clicks Confirm bid.
A bid of 0 is Nil: take no tricks at all.

00:00:13.099 --> 00:00:20.999 line:0
East, South and West each bid 3 as well;
both teams’ contracts are 6 tricks.

00:00:20.999 --> 00:00:28.998 line:0
Fast-forward: North leads, the winner leads next.
Follow the led suit; only a void may discard.

00:00:28.998 --> 00:00:35.098 line:0
North leads ♦4; the others must follow diamonds.

00:00:35.098 --> 00:00:42.998 line:0
East has none and trumps with ♠3; South covers
with the higher ♠5 and wins the trick.

00:00:42.998 --> 00:00:57.998 line:0
Fast-forward: every hand is bid and played anew.
Making the contract: 10 per bid trick; failing: −10.

00:00:57.998 --> 00:01:12.998 line:0
Each overtrick is 1 point but also a bag;
every 10 bags cost 100 points.

00:01:12.998 --> 00:01:23.000 line:0
North–South 503, East–West 474.
North–South reach 500 and lead: both partners win.
